{"ticker":"MDT","updated":"2026-10-30T22:58:41Z","profile":{"longName":"Medtronic plc","shortName":"Medtronic plc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"Ireland","website":"https://www.medtronic.com","fullTimeEmployees":95000,"marketCap":123487977472,"trailingPE":23.7199,"forwardPE":15.070082,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.2893288,"pegRatio":1.74,"targetMeanPrice":104.61538,"targetHighPrice":121.0,"targetLowPrice":85.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.137,"earningsGrowth":0.407,"grossMargins":0.65271,"operatingMargins":0.19332,"profitMargins":0.13934,"totalRevenue":37541998592,"beta":0.567,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":106.33,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":73.31,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.97},"summary":"Medtronic plc develops, manufactures, and sells device-based medical therapies to healthcare systems, physicians, clinicians, and patients in the United States, Ireland, and internationally. It operates through three segments: The Cardiovascular Portfolio, Neuroscience Portfolio, and Medical Surgical Portfolio. The Cardiovascular Portfolio segment offers implantable cardiac pacemakers, cardioverter defibrillators, and cardiac resynchronization therapy devices; cardiac ablation products; insertable cardiac monitor systems; TYRX products; and remote monitoring and patient-centered software. It also provides aortic valves, surgical valve replacement and repair products, endovascular stent grafts and accessories, and transcatheter pulmonary valves, left atrial appendage exclusion systems, extracorporeal membrane oxygenation (ECMO) systems and percutaneous coronary intervention products, percutaneous angioplasty balloons, and endovenous products. The Neuroscience Portfolio segment offers medical devices and implants, biologic solutions, spinal cord stimulation and brain modulation systems, implantable drug infusion systems, and interventional products, as well as nerve ablation system under the Accurian name. This segment offers its products for spinal surgeons, neurosurgeons, neurologists, pain management specialists, anesthesiologists, orthopedic surgeons, urologists, urogynecolog","summary_zh":"美敦力公司（Medtronic plc）為美國、愛爾蘭和國際上的醫療保健系統、醫生、臨床醫生和患者開發、製造和銷售基於設備的醫療療法。它透過三個部門運作：心血管產品組合、神經科學產品組合和醫療外科產品組合。心血管產品部門提供植入式心臟節律器、心臟復律去顫器和心臟再同步治療設備；心臟消融產品；插入式心臟監護系統； TYRX 產品；以及遠端監控和以患者為中心的軟體。它還提供主動脈瓣、手術瓣膜置換和修復產品、血管內支架移植物和配件、經導管肺動脈瓣、左心耳排除系統、體外膜氧合（ECMO）系統和經皮冠狀動脈介入產品、經皮血管成形球囊和靜脈內產品。神經科學產品組合部門提供醫療設備和植入物、生物解決方案、脊髓刺激和大腦調節系統、植入式藥物輸注系統和介入產品，以及 Accurian 名稱下的神經消融系統。該部門為脊椎外科醫生、神經外科醫生、神經科醫生、疼痛管理專家、麻醉科醫生、整形外科醫生、泌尿科醫生、泌尿婦科醫生提供產品","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":92.54,"h":93.83,"l":92.41,"c":93.33,"v":7150300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":93.15,"h":93.56,"l":91.42,"c":92.25,"v":5365400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":92.26,"h":94.35,"l":91.79,"c":92.85,"v":6641400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":93.14,"h":93.94,"l":92.52,"c":92.9,"v":4856900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":92.16,"h":93.0,"l":91.39,"c":92.99,"v":5024100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":92.84,"h":94.31,"l":92.73,"c":94.07,"v":7038300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":94.25,"h":94.3,"l":91.59,"c":92.32,"v":5625500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":92.31,"h":94.27,"l":92.25,"c":94.25,"v":6957800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":93.96,"h":95.29,"l":93.51,"c":94.03,"v":7334200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":94.6,"h":94.93,"l":93.22,"c":93.43,"v":5716300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":93.27,"h":95.54,"l":93.27,"c":94.19,"v":7722300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":94.42,"h":95.12,"l":93.81,"c":94.58,"v":8145800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":94.49,"h":95.64,"l":93.82,"c":95.59,"v":9364500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":95.91,"h":95.91,"l":94.08,"c":95.08,"v":15677000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":95.39,"h":95.5,"l":94.3,"c":94.62,"v":7581600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":94.52,"h":95.66,"l":94.17,"c":94.96,"v":7101000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":94.85,"h":95.99,"l":94.8,"c":95.74,"v":11265300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":95.27,"h":95.63,"l":92.72,"c":94.3,"v":7560800},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":93.85,"h":94.73,"l":93.48,