le":"Medtronic PLC (NYSE:MDT) Sees Significant Increase in Short Interest","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPSzZQR0x2b2ZjdGNlRzM3LVlaM1lkdTJDVG11NGhodFNiQXNOYklIc0VGTFBabnl2dkRRVEVXRnNOMzkzSHVxcjFpaXNnVjdvS3pkVWpZQlNMb19IUFAxdm9hd2ZtUFZoclU4T0phQV9JU2JmdkZoc3ZiMVc2SjA2YTRsVnpZeWFqR2xQOG5jVkpLY0UydmFpMm91dXBoRkJsNVJSMFBCR3lNVTVibFFmWDEzM0pSTVdWN3dyVVdFWFhxTjZOdUY4?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":""},{"title":"Medtronic's Q2 2027 Earnings: What to Expect","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQeVotTjRZVE9mS2FKZERRMk5vZ0xTRUhYdHVKOW1fWnBPSXUtRE10V1liUlJuaThkTG1hXzhlajNVd0V3ZGJrQnM0TEVhZGNUNlRCOFBYb1JOakh2TWF5V2FBRVBtV2h3bTQ4bHl5cm1BeHFndHBnc3pmTG8xRGRFRk5wQU1pMWlMNGJGVUNIRkFHLXJ1QXVoWF9IRQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"美敦力 2027 年第二季財報：預期如何"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-06-18","period":"2026-04-24","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1613103/000162828026044354/mdt-20260424.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Medtronic plc, headquartered in Galway, Ireland, is the leading global healthcare technology company. Medtronic was founded in 1949 and today serves healthcare systems, physicians, clinicians, and patients in more than 150 countries worldwide. We remain committed to a mission written by our founder in 1960 that directs us \"to contribute to human welfare by the application of biomedical engineering in the research, design, manufacture, and sale of products to alleviate pain, restore health, and extend life.\"","zh":"美敦力公司總部位於愛爾蘭戈爾韋，是全球領先的醫療保健技術公司。美敦力 (Medtronic) 成立於 1949 年，如今為全球 150 多個國家的醫療保健系統、醫生、臨床醫生和患者提供服務。我們仍然致力於實踐創始人於 1960 年制定的使命，該使命指示我們“通過在產品的研究、設計、製造和銷售中應用生物醫學工程來減輕疼痛、恢復健康和延長壽命，為人類福祉做出貢獻。”"},{"en":"Our Mission — to alleviate pain, restore health, and extend life — empowers us to engineer the extraordinary and deliver better outcomes for our world. We are a company of dedication, honesty, integrity, and service. Building on this strong foundation, we are embracing our role as a healthcare technology leader and evolving our business strategy in three key areas:","zh":"我們的使命是減輕痛苦、恢復健康和延長壽命，使我們能夠創造非凡的成果，為世界帶來更好的成果。我們是一家專注、誠實、正直、服務的公司。在此堅實的基礎上，我們將發揮醫療保健技術領導者的作用，並在三個關鍵領域發展我們的業務策略："},{"en":"Accelerate innovation-driven growth: The combination of our attractive end markets, recent product launches and robust pipeline is expected to enable continued strong revenue growth. We aim to bring inventive and disruptive technology to large healthcare opportunities which enables us to better meet patient needs. Patients around the world deserve access to our life-saving products, and we are driven to use our local presence and scale to increase the adoption of our products and services in markets around the globe.","zh":"加速創新驅動的成長：我們有吸引力的終端市場、最近的產品發布和強大的管道相結合，預計將實現持續強勁的收入成長。我們的目標是將創造性和顛覆性技術引入大型醫療保健機會，使我們能夠更好地滿足患者的需求。世界各地的患者都應該獲得我們的救生產品，我們致力於利用我們在當地的影響力和規模來提高我們的產品和服務在全球市場的採用率。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-04-24","items":[{"name":"Total Reportable Segments","val":33079000000,"zh":"可報告分部總計"},{"name":"Cardiovascular","val":13976000000,"zh":"心血管"},{"name":"Neuroscience Group","val":10287000000,"zh":"神經科學組"},{"name":"Medical Surgical","val":8815000000,"zh":"醫療外科"},{"name":"Other Operating Segments Including Diabetes","val":3247000000,"zh":"其他業務領域包括糖尿病"},{"name":"Diabetes Group","val":3112000000,"zh":"糖尿病組"},{"name":"Other Operating Segment Misc","val":135000000,"zh":"其他經營部門雜項"}],"total":36364000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-04-24","items":[{"name":"Total Other Countries Excluding Ireland","val":36221000000,"zh":"除愛爾蘭外的其他國家總數"},{"name":"Non Us","val":18261000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"Total Other Countries Excluding United Statesand Ireland","val":18118000000,"zh":"美國和愛爾蘭以外的其他國家總數"},{"name":"US","val":18103000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"IE","val":143000000,"zh":"愛爾蘭"}],"total":36364000000}},"peers":["ABT","BSX","SYK","AMGN","BMY"]}}